  "reference": "Egetabu ki’Emebeyano 1",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Engencho Enene Y’emebayeno",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eye nero emebayeno ya Sulemani mosinto o Daudi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emebayeno eyio eragere abanto bamanye obong’aini na amorokererio y’okorongeyia, naende bamanye amang’ana are nengeencho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase ero abanto mbanyore amorokererio akorenta obong’aini, na oboronge, na ekeene, na ogokora kw’oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emebayeno eyio nigo erae abatamanyeti amaange bamanye chiseemi, naende nigo erorokererie ekegori egeke getware obomanyi na emeroberio emiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase okoigwa emebayeno eyio omonto omong’aini nigo akong’ainia goetania, na oyore nobomanyi bwenyorera ogosemigwa okuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase emebayeno eyio abanto ’mbanyaare kweorokereria emebayeno na eki egoteeba; boigo ’mbamanye amang’ana y’abanto abang’aini na emebayeno yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogoseemia Ekiare Egeke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okomoiroka Omonene, n’oro omochakano bwe chiseemi. Abariri nigo bagochaaya obong’aini na amorokererio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, igwera amorokererio a iso, na tobaisa gotiga aria nyoko akogochika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nigo arabe buna egetinti gechabeire ase omotwe oo, na buna chisonoi chingiya chire ase rigoti ria’o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, abanyabibe kobarakoebererie ng’a mobwatane nabarabwo, tobaisa gwancha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baise kogoteebia, “Inchuo ogeende amo naintwe; toboere abanto tobaite, toumokere onde bwensi otari na komocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchuo tobamere kobare moyo, buna aase abakuure akomera, bageende abagima ase embeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio tonyore chinibo chionsi chie rigori rinene, toichorie chinyomba chiaito nebisakorwa ebio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchuo obwatane amo naintwe; tobe n’ekegaancha ekemo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, tobaisa gotaara amo nabarabwo. Otange okogoro kwao tikobaisa gotacha ase bagoeta,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera amagoro abo nigo akominyoka gochia ase ogokora amabe, na nigo bare abaango ase ogoitera amanyinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo ere bosa gotegera chinyoni ebisugunia ekero chibiroche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo nigo bakoboera goitera amanyinga abo abanyene, na koumokera obogima bwabo abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo omoerio bwe chiinchera chiabo ore, baria baganetie konyora chinibo ase ribero. Chinibo chiria nigo chigosiria obogima bw’abwo bagochinyora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini Nkorangeria Bore",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini nigo bogoaka eriogi rinene ase chiinchera, boigo nase chichiiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bogoaka eriogi rinene ase emesangererekano emenene y’abanto, naende ase ebiita bi’emechie, bwateeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngoika ririri inwe abamotamanyeti amaange moranche ogotamanya kwaino? Ngoika ririri abachecheria baregokie nogochecheria kwabo, na abariri bageche chiseemi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moise koonchoka moigwe ogokuurera kw’ane, rirorio nimbaiterere omoika one, ’mbamanyie amang’ana ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabeire ’nkobarangeria, korende mwangire konyigwera; nabeire ’nkorambora okoboko kw’ane, korende monto onde tari okorigereirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwachaayire ogoseemia kw’ane gwonsi, gose onde tari oigwerete ogokuurera kw’ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio inche nimbasekerere ekero emechando erabachere. Nimbachecherie ekero obwoba borabaachere;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ee, ekero obwoba borabaachere buna ekembugu‐mbugu, na emechando buna ekerambauti, boigo ekero obokong’u na omoichano birabaachere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio barabwo ’mbandangerie, korende tinkobaigwa; ’mbandigie, korende tibakonyora inche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo nigo bageechete chiseemi tibancheti komoiroka Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibancheti koigwera ring’ana riane ri’okobaseemia nonya nerimo; nigo bachaayete ogokuurera kw’ane gwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio ’mbarie okwama kw’ogokora kwabo, baisaneke n’emeroberio yabo abanyene",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoirana magega kw’abwo batamanyeti amaange ’nkobaite, na ogoisaneka kw’abariri ’nkobasirie barabwo abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende monto onde bwensi oranyigwere namenye ase omorembe, ere nabe n’obotoereru na takoiroka bobe bonde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
